From Roger.Bivand at nhh.no  Tue Dec 11 07:04:06 2001
From: Roger.Bivand at nhh.no (Roger Bivand)
Date: Tue Dec 11 07:04:06 2001
Subject: [STATSGRASS] Release of R interface GRASS_0.1-8
Message-ID: <Pine.LNX.4.21.0112111256280.14294-100000@reclus.nhh.no>

A revised interface between GRASS 5.0beta, including 5.0.0pre and the R
data analysis and statistics programming environment has been released.

It may be downloaded from ftp://reclus.nhh.no/pub/R/GRASS_0.1-8.tar.gz,
and should be on CRAN before long:
http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Devel/GRASS_0.1-8.tar.gz

All sites can now be moved with sites.get(), with argument all.sites=TRUE.

